          h2 Edit an article
          text Contributing is easy: see . For a quick summary on participating, see , and for a friendly tutorial, see . The  outlines our key policies and guidelines, while the  and  can remind you of basic .
          link "how to edit a page" https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Editing
