          h2 Report a problem with an article
          text If there is a problem with an article about yourself, a family member, a friend or a colleague, please read .
          link "Biographies of living persons/Help" https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Biographies_of_living_persons/Help
          text "If you spot a problem with an article, you can fix it directly, by clicking on the \"\" link at the top of that page.  for more information."
          text Edit
